Standalone DB Setup Guide

OS: projects/rhel-cloud/global/images/rhel-9-v20250709
VM Size: n2-highmem-16 (16 vCPUs, 128 GB Memory)


Infrastructure Creation Steps:
Navigate to the https://source.corp.google.com/piper///depot/google3/storage/alloydb/nova/test/gce/ folder and modify the cluster.sh file to specify the project and cluster name and os_image
OR
alternatively we can directly update variable of project and cluster-name and os_image  in defaults.conf
Execute the command: ./cluster-setup.sh create nodes=db:1,external:1.
Update the terraform/variables.tf file variable os_image with value projects/rhel-cloud/global/images/rhel-9-v20250709.
This command provisions 1 DB Node.
Please run gcloud auth login and gcloud auth application-default login before running any gcloud or terraform command.

Log in to DB Node:

ssh -i ~/.ssh/google_compute_engine ${USER}_google_com@nic0.aman-db1.us-central1-c.c.alloydb-nova-tvc-sandbox.internal.gcpnode.com> ssh -i ~/.ssh/google_compute_engine 

Installation Steps for Standalone DB:

sudo tee -a /etc/yum.repos.d/artifact-registry-plugin.repo << EOF
[ar-plugin]
name=Artifact Registry Plugin
baseurl=https://packages.cloud.google.com/yum/repos/dnf-plugin-artifact-registry-stable
enabled=1
gpgcheck=1
repo_gpgcheck=0
gpgkey=http://dl.google.com/linux/linux_signing_key.pub
EOF

sudo dnf install dnf-plugin-artifact-registry -y;

sudo tee -a /etc/yum.repos.d/artifact-registry.repo << EOF
[nova]
name=My Repository
baseurl=https://us-central1-yum.pkg.dev/projects/alloydb-omni-sandbox/nova
enabled=1
repo_gpgcheck=0
gpgcheck=1
gpgkey=http://dl.google.com/linux/linux_signing_key.pub
EOF

sudo dnf makecache -y;
sudo dnf install alloydbomni -y;
pg_repo=https://download.postgresql.org/pub/repos/yum/reporpms/EL-9-x86_64/;
sudo dnf install -y $pg_repo/pgdg-redhat-repo-latest.noarch.rpm;
sudo dnf install -y postgresql16;
sudo setenforce 0;
sudo firewall-cmd --add-port=5432/tcp --permanent;
sudo firewall-cmd --reload;
sudo rm -rf /var/lib/postgresql/16/main;
sudo PGPASSWORD=abcdefgh /usr/lib/postgresql/16/bin/alloydbomni-16-setup initdb;
sudo systemctl enable alloydbomni-16;
sudo systemctl start alloydbomni-16;
sudo systemctl status alloydbomni-16;


