Login to Backup VM:

Take Full Backup
sudo -u pgbackrest pgbackrest --config=/etc/pgbackrest.conf --stanza=standalone --type=full backup

Now Add more data to DB:

	INSERT INTO employees (first_name, last_name, department, salary)
